    "final_answer": "I now have all the information needed to answer the question. Here's a summary:\n\n## Final Answer\n\n### Next Los Angeles Lakers Game (from ESPN)\nThe next game for the Los Angeles Lakers is **Monday, October 5, 2026 at 7:00 PM** (PT) — an NBA Preseason away game at the Sacramento Kings at Golden 1 Center.\n\n*Note: ESPN's homepage displayed this as \"10/6/26 at 10:00 AM\" due to timezone conversion (UTC). VividSeats shows the local time of Oct 5 at 7:00 PM PT.*\n\n### Cheapest Ticket Available (from VividSeats - the ticket purchasing website linked from ESPN)\nClicking the \"Tickets\" link from ESPN's Lakers page navigated to **VividSeats**, where applying the \"Tickets under $50\" filter shows the following Lakers games:\n\n| Date | Matchup | Venue | Starting Price |\n|------|---------|-------|----------------|\n| **Mon Oct 5, 7:00 PM** | Lakers at Sacramento Kings | Golden 1 Center | **From $21** ⬅️ Cheapest |\n| Thu Oct 8, TBD | Sacramento Kings at Lakers | Crypto.com Arena | From $32 |\n| Fri Oct 16, TBD | Denver Nuggets at Lakers | Crypto.com Arena | From $42 |\n\n**The cheapest ticket available is $21** — for the next Lakers game against the Sacramento Kings on Monday, October 5, 2026 at Golden 1 Center in Sacramento, CA.\n\n(Note: There is also a $15 ticket shown on the page, but that is for a Portland Trail Blazers vs. Sacramento Kings game — not a Lakers game.)",
